# Why `c6i.large` Rebalancing Failed — Evidence from Real Data

> **Action #109** | Cluster: `spot-demo-1` (`301c09b0`) | Region: `ap-south-1`
> **Time**: 2026-03-11 12:01:12 UTC (~5.5 hours ago)

---

## What the Database Says

### Rebalancing Action #109

| Field | Value |
|---|---|
| **Source** | `t3.medium:ap-south-1a` |
| **Target** | `c6i.large:ap-south-1b` |
| **Instance** | `i-09ac7926aee3c7c0c` (currently SPOT, running) |
| **Status** | `failed` |
| **Error** | `Direct spot EC2 launch failed: no spot capacity available for types ['c6i.large', 'c5.large', 't3.medium']. Try again later.` |
| **Metadata** | `target_instance_type: t3.medium`, `bin_packed: false` |

